@startuml C4_Generate_Operation_Plans_Logical_Deployment
title C4 – Plan Generation (Logical Deployment View)
left to right direction

skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor LightGray
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

node "Operator Device" as Device {
  artifact "Angular SPA\n(Operation Plans Module)" as Spa
}

node "PLMS API Cluster" as ApiCluster {
  artifact "TodoApi Container\n(OemProxyController)" as Api
  artifact "Observability Agent" as Observability
}

cloud "Identity Platform" as Identity {
  artifact "OIDC Authority" as Oidc
}

cloud "OEM Planning Platform" as OEM {
  artifact "Preview Endpoint"
  artifact "Generate Endpoint"
  artifact "Missing Plans Endpoint"
  artifact "Operations Store" as Store
}

cloud "Support Services" as Support {
  artifact "VVN Catalog API"
  artifact "Resource Catalog API"
}

Operator --> Spa : HTTPS (Browser)
Spa --> Api : POST preview/generate/missing
Api --> Oidc : Validate tokens
Api --> Preview Endpoint : Forward preview requests
Api --> Generate Endpoint : Persist plans
Api --> Missing Plans Endpoint : Retrieve missing VVNs
Preview Endpoint --> Store : read operations data
Generate Endpoint --> Store : write plans + metadata
Spa --> Support : fetch VVNs/resources for forms
Api --> Observability : Emit telemetry

@enduml
